WEBVTT

NOTE On-screen text of the AR-DUINO thesis introduction video, with English translations of the chat lines.

00:00.000 --> 00:02.000
[Chat] "tara pre aral arduino" (Let's study Arduino, bro)

00:02.000 --> 00:04.000
"yoko pre" (Nah, bro)

00:04.000 --> 00:06.000
"bat naman" (Why not?)

00:06.000 --> 00:09.000
"gagi nasabugan ako haha" (Dude, a part blew up on me, haha)

00:09.000 --> 00:11.500
"di ko pa kasi alam to eh" (I don't really know this stuff yet)

00:11.500 --> 00:14.000
"hirap pre ang gastos" (It's hard, bro, and expensive)

00:14.000 --> 00:18.000
[The AR-DUINO-M app installs]

00:18.000 --> 00:22.000
AR-DUINO-M: 3D simulation, AR visualization, zero cost, build safely

00:22.000 --> 00:26.000
1. Download the app  2. Choose a project  3. Learn the steps  4. Build the project  5. Run the simulation

00:26.000 --> 00:30.000
Interactive learning: simple drag-and-drop interaction, Arduino simulations built from 3D components, no internet needed

00:30.000 --> 00:34.000
AR visualization: open the website, go to Components, find a component, point your camera, view details

00:34.000 --> 00:41.000
Visit our website and download the app: ar-duino-m.vercel.app
